# 4. Starting a race on Kenya (course 41, route node 30) from power-on with a fresh EEPROM:
#    the route node and stage bytes $2080A0-$2080A6 written after the race init cleared them
#    (substate 2 at frame 767, $323E) and before the course is loaded (frame 2571).
#    A0 alone selects the course; A1-A6 make the bookkeeping (and the HUD's "FINAL STAGE") agree.
include race_mp.inc
2500 w8 $2080a0 30
2500 w8 $2080a1 30
2500 w8 $2080a3 30
2500 w8 $2080a6 30
2500 w8 $2080a2 5
2500 w8 $2080a4 5
2500 w8 $2080a5 5
1 watch $20060f 1
2600 p8 $20060f
2700 snap e04_2700.png
3100 snap e04_3100.png
3200 snap e04_3200.png
3200 exit
